{"version":1,"content":"<p>據市場分析機構Alinea Analytics分析師Rhys Elliott近日發佈的數據，《俠盜獵車手VI》（GTA VI）在首發周末結束時，全球銷量已達到約4490萬份，對應總收入超過40億美元。這一成績顯示，該作在發售首日刷新娛樂產業多項紀錄後，又以極具衝擊力的方式完成了首個周末的爆發。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587762.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.195921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:49:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"02138e243b33e49d8006589b2f7f8d7c44e31d3e2856dda865cd77ae5846d466","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}